-and-vertical-scroll-container"]},{"name":"unity-content-viewport","type":"VisualElement","visible":true,"enabled":true,"text":null,"bounds":[42,919,368,97],"fontSize":18.0,"classes":["unity-scroll-view__content-viewport","unity-scroll-view__content-viewport--vertical"]},{"name":"unity-content-container","type":"VisualElement","visible":true,"enabled":true,"text":null,"bounds":[42,286,368,730],"fontSize":18.0,"classes":["unity-scroll-view__content-container","unity-scroll-view__content-container--vertical"]},{"name":"log","type":"Label","visible":true,"enabled":true,"text":"Lattice Jack: Link established to Crosswind Reach.\nRing Gate: Destination offline. The far ring has gone quiet.\nRing Gate: Destination offline. The far ring has gone quiet.\nWarden Ossa: New scavenger? Nobody walks the Berms unarmed. I'm Ossa, on West Gate watch. Take the scrap pistol from the ARMS LOCKER under the canopy at my post; the cyan light marks it. Then use the range across the lane.\nWarden Ossa: It runs on nano charge, not rounds. Press 7 to draw it.\nSystem: Scrap pistol drawn. Hold right mouse to aim.\nWarden Ossa: Those are training targets: three numbered steel plates on hinged stands. Hold right mouse to aim, then left click to fire; F fires from the hip. Knock down all three. The range control raises them for practice after the primer.\nWarden Ossa: Movement on the service road. A scrap drone's slipped its cluster. They back off before they dart in, so shoot on the tell.\nWarden Ossa: The rest of its cluster is nested at the old machine depot, south along the road. Clear it out. Break contact if you're hurt; vitality comes back, and nano refills when you stop firing.\nField Pack: Collected: Scrap Alloy \u00d71, Nanite Residue \u00d73, Copper Filament \u00d71\nOuter Berms: You go down in the dust. A Warden patrol drags you back to the post.\nSystem: Scrap pistol drawn. Hold right mouse to aim.\nWarden Ossa: Clean work. Bring that servo to the field fabricator at my post; a steadier grip will tame that pistol. The rest of the salvage sells at Basic General.\nField Pack: Collected: Damaged Servo \u00d71, Scrap Alloy \u00d72, Nanite Residue \u00d71 Schematic discovered: Stabilised Pistol Grip.\nField Pack: Collected: Damaged Servo \u00d71, Scrap Alloy \u00d71, Nanite Residue \u00d71\nField Pack: Collected: Scrap Alloy \u00d71, Nanite Residue \u00d72","bounds":[42,286,368,730],"fontSize":18.0,"classes":["unity-label","unity-text-element"]},{"name":"unity-slider","type":"ScrollerSlider","visible":true,"enabled":true,"text":null,"bounds":[416,943,24,49],"fontSize":18.0,"classes":["unity-base-slider--vertical","unity-base-field","unity-base-slider","unity-scroller__slider","unity-slider","unity-base-field--no-label"]},{"name":"unity-drag-container","type":"VisualElement","visible":true,"enabled":true,"text":null,"bounds":[416,943,24,49],"fontSize":18.0,"classes":["unity-base-slider__drag-container"]},{"name":"unity-tracker","type":"VisualElement","visible":true,"enabled":true,"text":null,"bounds":[416,943,24,49],"fontSize":18.0,"classes":["unity-base-slider__tracker"]},{"name":"unity-dragger","type":"VisualElement","visible":true,"enabled":true,"text":null,"bounds":[419,985,18,7],"fontSize":18.0,"classes":["unity-base-slider__dragger"]},{"name":"chat-footer","type":"VisualElement","visible":true,"enabled":true,"text":null,"bounds":[42,1021,386,27],"fontSize":18.0,"classes":["chat-footer"]},{"name":"","type":"Label","visible":true,"enabled":true,"text":"Local transmissions","bounds":[73,1032,116,15],"fontSize":16.0,"classes":["unity-label","unity-text-element","muted","small"]},{"name":"quickbar","type":"VisualElement","visible":true,"enabled":true,"text":null,"bounds":[616,970,688,90],"fontSize":18.0,"classes":["movable-window"]},{"name":"hotbar","type":"VisualElement","visible":true,"enabled":true,"text":null,"bounds":[616,970,688,90],"fontSize":18.0,"classes":["panel"]},{"name":"slot1","type":"Button","visible":true,"enabled":true,"text":"","b